WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
More AI tools? More computers? Let’s get them working together.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Choose an authorized computer. Hand over the task. Follow who received it, what changed, and how it turned out.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Codex, Claude, Gemini, and your own agent. Connect familiar tools, continue the conversation, and choose the right model for the work.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:41.000
On a configured node, the Gemini desktop App receives work, writes files and runs tests. Keep the App open; its native tool approvals still apply.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Acceptance records show five Gemini desktop tests passed. The CTE bridge completed isolated changes and successful tests. The original project stayed unchanged.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Your tools. Your computers. Start with the quick guide. SmartCluster Preview Two.
